QUESTIONABLE/PROJECTION. CHECK-030d complete behind its owner; no 030d code read or run.

No numerical mismatch in 550 numbers. I re-derived 85 P2 values with my own code (model49, which reproduces 048 bit for bit), and all match:
- the whole R10 bill: +118.694826 kg named endpoint, +0.000003 kg least point;
- the least point: gamma 0.498375922, Q 0.710673963, film 0.081667779, usage 0.842794177;
- the cure-included R10-15 table: 18 endpoints within 0.0005 kg, and every least set;
- 052's comparison points, the 1 mm best (-998.333 kg) and both lost AgFEP floats.

My own arithmetic confirms R30 Be at 102.230791 t (23.610%/23.775%), six Weibull scales, 18 reports, 408 pins, intact snapshots, 51 links, 104 rows and 1553 findings. Four sub-workers traced 449 more to source reports, with no mismatches.

Wording: 10 items, four of which change the reading:
- line 143 reverses Pach's stored (1.1 in a metres field) and corrected (0.0011 m) depth;
- line 213's +82.640676 kg is 048's unnamed all-four endpoint;
- line 23 calls 040's repair an allowance;
- line 244 names four of five new grounding routes.
Typography: 22 joined tokens ("2, 027, 245", "AtR30", "colderh 2").

The pending list was correct at filing. Since then eight reports have filed, for a 030e: CHECK-029, 049, 051-complete, CHECK-052, CHECK-048 complete with its thermal reply, 053 and 054.

Scope: other cards' model outputs were traced, not recomputed. Of the 432 1 mm cases, 24 were recomputed, including the best. Four NFI/fix rows.
